gui.antistuck.tip.master=§eIntelligent anti-jamming system§r\n§7When enabled, all anti-jamming logic will be activated, \n§7 includes predictive avoidance and intelligent escape in complex terrain.
gui.antistuck.tip.avoid=After §eactively avoids dangerous areas§r\n§7 is enabled, when the pathfinding path is about to enter \n§7 a dangerous area composed of vines, spider webs, etc., \n§7 will calculate and detour in advance.
gui.antistuck.tip.timeout=§eTimeout automatic reload§r\n§7 is enabled, if the player does not move at all within the specified time \n§7, the system will force a reload state, \n§7 returns to the center point and chases monsters again. This is the ultimate insurance policy.
